{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1496270-durability-scale-defense","id":1496270,"title":"Durability Scale & Defense","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-11-05T13:02:14-07:00","id":1496270,"title":"Durability Scale & Defense","content":"Does Durability Scale add to an antagonist Defense or a PC's Soft Armor like it does in Trinity? Or does it just add Injury Condition slots?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I\u2019m a writer. A storyteller. They\u2019re my passions. They\u2019re what I do. The stories I tell, they are my mythologies. Like the Norse tales of Odin, Thor, and Loki, or the Celtic fables of Lugh or C\u00fa Chulainn, I want them to be the kind that people retell. They are the legacies I wish to leave behind.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/577-archasimos","name":"Archasimos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar577_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"180"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-05T13:47:59-07:00","id":1496274,"title":"","content":"Scion don\u2019t have the well defined set of scales, but, other than that, if you have scale against an attack it is added to your defense because defense is the difficulty of the action.<br /> <br /> The rule of using durability scale as increase in soft armor is a restricted rule to make it obvious that it would impact the difficulty of disarming the target or to grapple it. The idea behind it is Scale only apply when it makes sense, but it can be specially confusing.<br /> <br /> In Scion, your increase in Scale may mean you dodge specially fast or can block specially fast, not necessarily that you are bullet prof. Think Goku when some one shoot him with a gun, he doesn\u2019t let it hit, because it would kill him, instead he blocks the bullet with his finger (yes, that\u2019s the weird part). Scion may use the same to gain scale, while in Aberrant you are just too hard to worry about that little shot.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":24985,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","user":"Mateus Luz","date":". 11-05-2022, 05:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}